<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115677" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφοφορ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψᾱφο-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vote by ballot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1268a2
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειροτονία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1446b22
			</span></i>: generally, <i>voting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Foed.Delph.Pell.
				1
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.189S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ὑπατικαὶ ψ.</span>
			<i>voting</i> at the consular comitia, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>judgment, decree,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Astron.,
				<i>calculation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				4.9
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				1.27
			</span></i>, etc.:—sts. written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφηφορία</span></b> , as in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
			</span></i>l.c.</div>
